### =====================================================
### Customer Vehicle Management API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:5093
### =====================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5093
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_OR_EMPLOYEE_TOKEN_HERE
@vehicleId = 1
@userId = USER_ID_HERE

### =====================================================
### STEP 1: Register a new customer (if needed)
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### =====================================================
### STEP 2: Login to get access token
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Copy the accessToken from the response above and set it in @token variable

### =====================================================
### STEP 3: Register/Login as Admin or Employee (for testing admin endpoints)
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Login as Admin/Employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Copy the accessToken and set it in @adminToken variable

### =====================================================
### CUSTOMER ENDPOINTS (Require Customer Role)
### =====================================================

### GET ALL VEHICLES - Get all vehicles for logged-in customer
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### GET VEHICLE BY ID - Get specific vehicle details
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### ADD VEHICLE - Add a new vehicle to customer profile
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Axio",
  "year": "2017",
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "plateNumber": "CAC-4455",
  "company": "Toyota"
}

### =====================================================
### ADD ANOTHER VEHICLE - Add second vehicle
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Civic",
  "year": "2020",
  "vin": "2HGFC2F59LH123456",
  "plateNumber": "ABC-1234",
  "company": "Honda"
}

### =====================================================
### ADD VEHICLE - Add a BMW
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "X5",
  "year": "2022",
  "vin": "5UXCR6C0XN9L12345",
  "plateNumber": "BMW-7890",
  "company": "BMW"
}

### =====================================================
### ADD VEHICLE WITHOUT COMPANY (optional field)
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Alto",
  "year": "2019",
  "vin": "9BWZZZ377VT004251",
  "plateNumber": "XYZ-5678"
}

### =====================================================
### DELETE VEHICLE - Delete a specific vehicle
### =====================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### ERROR CASES
### =====================================================

### Try to add vehicle with duplicate VIN (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Duplicate",
  "year": "2021",
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "plateNumber": "DUP-1111",
  "company": "Test"
}

### Try to add vehicle with missing required fields (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Incomplete",
  "year": "2021"
}

### Try to access without token (should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles

### Try to delete non-existent vehicle (should fail with 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### ADMIN/EMPLOYEE ENDPOINTS (Access by User ID)
### =====================================================

### GET ALL VEHICLES IN SYSTEM - Admin/Employee can see all vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### GET ALL VEHICLES BY USER ID - Get all vehicles for a specific user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### GET SPECIFIC VEHICLE BY USER ID AND VEHICLE ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADD VEHICLE FOR SPECIFIC USER - Admin adds vehicle for a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Mercedes S-Class",
  "year": "2023",
  "vin": "WDDUG8GB5NA123456",
  "plateNumber": "ADMIN-001",
  "company": "Mercedes-Benz"
}

### DELETE VEHICLE FOR SPECIFIC USER - Admin deletes vehicle for a customer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =====================================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINT ERROR CASES
### =====================================================

### Try to access user vehicles as Customer (should fail with 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Try to add vehicle for user as Customer (should fail with 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Test",
  "year": "2023",
  "vin": "TEST123456",
  "plateNumber": "TEST-001"
}

### Try to access user vehicles without token (should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/user/{{userId}}

### =====================================================
### NOTES:
### =====================================================
### CUSTOMER ENDPOINTS (Role: Customer):
### 1. GET /api/Vehicles - Get my vehicles
### 2. GET /api/Vehicles/{vehicleId} - Get my specific vehicle
### 3. POST /api/Vehicles - Add vehicle to my profile
### 4. DELETE /api/Vehicles/{vehicleId} - Delete my vehicle
###
### ADMIN/EMPLOYEE ENDPOINTS (Role: Admin, Employee):
### 5. GET /api/Vehicles/user/{userId} - Get all vehicles for a user
### 6. GET /api/Vehicles/user/{userId}/{vehicleId} - Get specific vehicle for a user
### 7. POST /api/Vehicles/user/{userId} - Add vehicle for a user
### 8. DELETE /api/Vehicles/user/{userId}/{vehicleId} - Delete vehicle for a user
###
### GENERAL RULES:
### 1. Customers can only manage their own vehicles
### 2. Admin/Employee can manage vehicles for any user
### 3. No one can edit vehicles, only add and delete them
### 4. VIN must be unique across the entire system
### 5. Plate number must be unique per customer
### 6. Vehicles with existing appointments cannot be deleted
### 7. Model, Year, VIN, and PlateNumber are required fields
### 8. Company is optional
### 9. VIN and PlateNumber are automatically converted to uppercase
### =====================================================
